      "text": {
        "content": "Together, the children steadied the bridge, picked up the toy, and sat quietly under the tall green stalks. Kavi still felt the unfairness, but it no longer bossed every choice. Looking at the sheltering curve nearby, Kavi understood that real strength could feel soft and steady at the same time. ",
